  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development and sales of remote diagnostic respiratory disease testing device using IoT and AI to expand respiratory disease testing in Vietnam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As part of the Healthy Lung project, which supports primary medical institutions establishing respiratory centers in Vietnam, we plan to sell the device to hospitals participating in the Asthma and COPD Outpatient  Care Unit(ACOCU) and verify the reliability of the test device and the actual business model by processing health insurance claims. After that, we plan to use the sales network of Broad C&amp;amp;S Vietnam to sell the product to primary medical institutions and medical institutions providing remote treatment in Vietnam and increase the number of tests by encouraging visiting patients to take the test. Vietnam is currently a country where health insurance claims for remote treatment are possible. Since remote treatment is possible, we can distribute this product to Vietnamese medical institutions to enable continuous management of patients suspected of having respiratory diseases or smokers in vulnerable areas such as islands and mountainous regions.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this project is to expand the respiratory disease screening base in Vietnam, and to upgrade and deploy the respiratory disease screening device (The Spirokit) developed during the CTS SEED1 support period with remote medical support technology, thereby increasing the early diagnosis rate of respiratory disease patients, reducing mortality and medical costs due to respiratory diseases in Vietnam, and creating local jobs, achieving stable settlement, and creating sustainable impact.&#xc6d0;&#xaca9; &#xac80;&#xc0ac;&#xc2dc;&#xc2a4;&#xd15c; &#xd604;&#xc9c0;&#xd654; &#xbc0f; &#xc5f0;&#xb3d9;&#xc2dc;&#xc2a4;&#xd15c; &#xace0;&#xb3c4;&#xd654;, &#xc6d0;&#xaca9;&#xc9c4;&#xb8cc;&#xac00; &#xac00;&#xb2a5;&#xd55c; &#xb9cc;&#xc131;&#xd638;&#xd761;&#xae30;&#xc9c8;&#xd658;&#xac80;&#xc0ac;&#xae30; &#xbcf4;&#xae09; &#xbc0f; &#xd310;&#xb9e4; &#xc9c4;&#xd589;, &#xb9cc;&#xc131;&#xd638;&#xd761;&#xae30;&#xc9c8;&#xd658;&#xac80;&#xc0ac;&#xae30; &#xc0ac;&#xc6a9;&#xc790; &#xbaa8;&#xc9d1;</narrative>
  </description>
